# Features System

Dokan Kits implements a modular features system that allows for enabling/disabling specific functionality.

## Directory Structure

- [includes/Features/](mdc:includes/Features): Main features code
  - [Cart/](mdc:includes/Features/Cart): Cart-related features
  - [Order/](mdc:includes/Features/Order): Order-related features
  - [Product/](mdc:includes/Features/Product): Product-related features
  - [Shipping/](mdc:includes/Features/Shipping): Shipping-related features
  - [Vendor/](mdc:includes/Features/Vendor): Vendor-related features

## Feature Implementation

Each feature extends the AbstractFeature class and implements the FeatureInterface:

```php
namespace Dokan_Kits\Features\MyFeature;

use Dokan_Kits\Features\AbstractFeature;

class MyFeature extends AbstractFeature {
    protected string $name = 'My Feature';
    protected string $description = 'Description of my feature';
    protected string $option_key = 'my_feature_option_key';

    public function register_hooks(): void {
        // Register hooks for this feature
        add_action('init', [$this, 'init']);
    }

    public function init(): void {
        // Feature initialization code
    }
}
```

## Feature Registration

Features are registered through the FeaturesServiceProvider:

- [includes/Core/DI/Providers/FeaturesServiceProvider.php](mdc:includes/Core/DI/Providers/FeaturesServiceProvider.php): Registers features

## Feature Status

Features can be enabled or disabled through the admin dashboard:

- [includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Features.php](mdc:includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Features.php): Admin UI for managing features

Each feature implements an `is_enabled()` method that determines if the feature is active:

```php
public function is_enabled(): bool {
    // If option key is empty, feature is considered always enabled
    if (empty($this->option_key)) {
        return apply_filters('dokan_kits_feature_' . $this->get_slug() . '_enabled', true, $this);
    }

    $enabled = get_option($this->option_key, false) === '1';

    return apply_filters('dokan_kits_feature_' . $this->get_slug() . '_enabled', $enabled, $this);
}
```
